ui.patchnote.350:
Halloween has come to the Plaguelands! Take part in events and get holiday rewards.
— The Deceased Village has been found near the home of the Exiles. Explore this gloomy place;
— Help the Witch complete a ritual to get a rare weapon and scrolls;
— Add details to your appearance. Unlock unique face paint;
— Holiday sale: thematic interior decorations and sets await you.

ui.patchnote.341:
— Northern barbarians are gathering all the apostates under their banners, and the Scarlet Angels are calling Exiles to arms!
A 20-day Scarlet Hunt has been announced. You can expect 50 ranks, new events, brutal opponents, interesting quests, and unique rewards!
— New item recipes for those who like to be fully equipped;
— A limited sale for the thrifty;
— The amount of enchanted iron in the Traitors' Catacombs has been doubled.

